//! Runtime bytecode and ABI of `contracts/LegRunner.sol`, injected via `eth_simulateV1` state
//! overrides at the simulated trader for legs the pool pays out directly.
//!
//! Compiled with solc 0.8.30:
//! `solc --bin-runtime --via-ir --optimize --optimize-runs 200 --no-cbor-metadata
//! --evm-version berlin <contract>.sol`
